  "frontier_coordinate": "R-129 fixes the endpoint-owner direction and the legal reverse mechanism. The exact identity E_CN=P_comp+V/2 dominates the smaller R-123 owner and therefore cannot lower-bound it; endpoint subtraction has no variance sign. Direct signed covariance-normal differentiation cancels conditional-mean derivatives but leaves the owner-complete current-curvature bound open. Exact fixtures retire differentiated Poincare, entropy-only second-score control, temporal-increment shell intertwining, partition-only Parseval, cellwise quotient descent, and swapped geometric reverse labels; the Gaussian score route is parked at an unavailable endpoint moment. For an exhaustive orthogonal physical-shell analysis and an owner-complete physical response A with selfadjoint pullback, R=CL_pred and F=CA yield H=R^*F=F^*R. A proved physical forward estimate therefore transfers to its true predictable aggregate adjoint without temporal-shell commutation or shell-count loss, but pullback retains ||L_pred||. The shifted-Douglas theorem gives the exact prescribed three-channel gap after all production data exist. The live successor is A13-CLASSII-OWNER-COMPLETE-TRACE-EXCESS-PHYSICAL-RESPONSE-FORWARD-BALANCED-LOW-BOUND: construct the physical response and prove C_mix, C_far, c_bal, D, K, R0, S0, the absolute anchor, and the common-terminal owner once. R-128, R-127, R-125, R-123, R-120, R-119, R-103 REG, and R-087/R-093 CORE retain their owners. OVERLAP_src, Nelson, removals, interacting measure, and Sector A remain open.",
